<title>Australia: Australian P-Notes - Tenders total A$45 mln.</title>
<headline>Australian P-Notes - Tenders total A$45 mln.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Australian commercial paper market ended  a relatively slow week of supply from promissory note tenders with  just two reported on Friday totalling A$45 million. The largest of  the two was for ICI Australia which came for A$30 million dated for  November 3, which fetched</p>
<p>a yield of 4.99 percent.</p>
